stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Idle
    Idle --> Loading : fetch()
    Loading --> Ready : 200
    Loading --> Failed : error
    Failed --> Loading : retry
    Ready --> [*]
    state Ready {
        [*] --> Viewing
        Viewing --> Editing : edit
        Editing --> Viewing : save
    }
    state check <<choice>>
    Failed --> check
    check --> Idle : give up
    Idle : waits for input
    note right of Failed : shows a toast
